  "details": "As an Australian user of vrchat, I would like to request the addition of Australian servers. This would improve performance for Australian users by reducing latency and providing a more consistent experience.\n\nCurrently, vrchat uses servers located in the US EU and JAPAN This can result in latency issues for Australian users, especially for users who are located in remote areas. For example, a user who is located in Sydney may experience latency of up to 200 milliseconds when connecting to a server in the United States. This latency can make it difficult to use vrchat in real-time worlds such as murder mystery freeze tag zombie tag and more",
